% $Id: pst-algparser.pro 350 2010-06-18 05:18:55Z herbert $
%%
%% PostScript prologue for PSTricks algorithm parser
%% Version 0.03, 2011/06/03
%%
%% This program can be redistributed and/or modified under the terms
